{"2396130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Australia Did It: End-of-the-World Railway Defense Business", "steam_appid": 2396130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396130/extras/de76e247cb37d558750292d532f1a1e3.avif?t=1787329037\" width=780 height=158 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From the co-creator of NUCLEAR THRONE, LUFTRAUSERS and RIDICULOUS FISHING comes a tactical strategy game for players who love deep unit buildcraft, hard positioning choices, and watching optimized plans survive....or collapse under pressure. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome aboard, Railrunner! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here at Ocean Traffic Collaboration (OTC), our motto is simple: <strong>every shipment must reach its destination.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decades ago, a mysterious catastrophic event dried up the Atlantic Ocean, leaving behind a hostile seabed crawling with oversized bugs, reanimated ancient weapons, mutated creatures, and various other obstacles to efficient cargo logistics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is simple: escort valuable cargo across this wasteland by train. To do that, you’ll need to build a crew, defend each station, evolve your units through tactical merging, and survive the dangerous journey to the next stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Australia Did It is a tactical turn-based strategy game about planning under pressure, building powerful unit synergies, and seeing whether your carefully crafted crew can survive when the train leaves the station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Responsibilities:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396130/extras/e65cf42fe7217c5c95f549e6bdcb43a8.poster.avif?t=1787329037\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396130/extras/e65cf42fe7217c5c95f549e6bdcb43a8.webm?t=1787329037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEFEND YOUR STATION</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before the train departs, strategically deploy and position your limited units to hold off relentless waves of enemies. Think chess, but faster and with potentially explosive mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396130/extras/547f448a209041b103a13d9de79b087f.poster.avif?t=1787329037\" width=616 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396130/extras/547f448a209041b103a13d9de79b087f.webm?t=1787329037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EVOLVE YOUR UNITS</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge units on the fly to unlock 1,500+ combinations across 30+ unit types. Create ridiculously powerful new units or niche specialists. Experimentation is key….. just try not to blow yourself up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396130/extras/c2d93ecb15af9579fba52dac2c440780.poster.avif?t=1787329037\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396130/extras/c2d93ecb15af9579fba52dac2c440780.webm?t=1787329037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVIVE THE JOURNEY</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the train departs, your crew enters Autobattler journeys where every merge, synergy, and build choice is tested against enemy hordes. Plan at the station. Prove it on the rails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend Your Train</strong> in compact tactical turn-based combat built around positioning, unit buildcraft, and threat prioritization.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Merge Units Into 1,500+ Variations</strong> and discover powerful build paths across 30+ unit types. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test Your Crew in Autobattler Journeys</strong> as your units fight through monster hordes between stations. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make Decisions That Carry Forward</strong> from station defense to survival on the rails. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deliver the Cargo</strong> through a world that very much wants you to fail. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist now to be notified when duty calls.</strong></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From the co-creator of NUCLEAR THRONE, LUFTRAUSERS and RIDICULOUS FISHING comes a tactical strategy game for players who love deep unit buildcraft, hard positioning choices, and watching optimized plans survive....or collapse under pressure. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>