istakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396130/extras/547f448a209041b103a13d9de79b087f.poster.avif?t=1787329037\" width=616 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396130/extras/547f448a209041b103a13d9de79b087f.webm?t=1787329037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EVOLVE YOUR UNITS</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge units on the fly to unlock 1,500+ combinations across 30+ unit types. Create ridiculously powerful new units or niche specialists. Experimentation is key….. just try not to blow yourself up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396130/extras/c2d93ecb15af9579fba52dac2c440780.poster.avif?t=1787329037\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396130/extras/c2d93ecb15af9579fba52dac2c440780.webm?t=1787329037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVIVE THE JOURNEY</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the train departs, your crew enters Autobattler journeys where every merge, synergy, and build choice is tested against enemy hordes. Plan at the station. Prove it on the rails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend Your Train</strong> in compact tactical turn-based combat built around positioning, unit buildcraft, and threat prioritization.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Merge Units Into 1,500+ Variations</strong> and discover powerful build paths across 30+ unit types. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test Your Crew in Autobattler Journeys</strong> as your units fight through monster hordes between stations. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make Decisions That Carry Forward</strong> from station defense to survival on the rails. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deliver the Cargo</strong> through a world that very much wants you to fail. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist now to be notified when duty calls.</strong></h2>", "short_description": "Deploy and merge units into 1,500+ variations to defend your train in tight Turn-Based Strategy battles, then see if your build survives Autobattler journeys between stations against massive monster hordes. Build you crew. Defend the train. Deliver the cargo.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Dutch, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Thai, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396130/e57abbbf1dabf4c72d0feb3da6923fcb2af25bb6/header.jpg?t=1787329037", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396130/97261bc2586a2c60b1e89349afcb591bdec6618f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787329037", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396130/97261bc2586a2c60b1e89349afcb591bdec6618f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787329037", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7, 8, 10<br></li><li><strong>P